    <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none theme-text-primary">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-black text-[#f3a833] mb-8">{title}</h1>
      
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
        Few things are as disappointing for a football fan as preparing for a major match only to find that <strong>Soccer100 is not working</strong>. Whether you're encountering a page error, a connection timeout, or persistent buffering during your <strong>soccer streams</strong> session, these technical hurdles can be incredibly frustrating. In this guide, we’ll break down why these issues occur and provide simple steps to resolve them quickly.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">Common Reasons Why Soccer100 May Not Work</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        Technical issues can stem from various sources, ranging from local browser problems to external network restrictions. Sometimes, your ISP may be limiting access, or our servers may be undergoing essential maintenance to handle peak match-day traffic. Identifying the root cause is the first step toward a fast fix.
      </p>

      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-8 mb-3">1. Outdated Browser Data</h3>
