      <p class="mb-6">
        To maintain the high quality of our service, <strong>Soccer100</strong> occasionally undergoes brief maintenance periods. These are usually timed to minimize impact on fans, but checking our official social media channels or looking for mirror links is a good way to see if the downtime is widespread.
