      <p class="mb-6">
        If you're having trouble accessing our platform, try these troubleshooting steps in order:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-4 mb-8">
        <li><strong>Perform a Hard Refresh:</strong> Use Ctrl + F5 (on Windows) to force your browser to reload the page from scratch, clearing temporary glitches.</li>
        <li><strong>Verify Your Connection:</strong> Ensure your internet speed is sufficient. High-quality <strong>soccer streams</strong> typically require a stable connection of at least 5-10 Mbps.</li>
        <li><strong>Try a Different Browser:</strong> If the site isn't loading in one browser, try another like Firefox or Brave. Extensions can sometimes interfere with our video player.</li>
        <li><strong>Review Your Ad-Blocker:</strong> While we aim for a clean experience, some aggressive ad-blockers can inadvertently block essential components of our streaming player.</li>
