      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#f3a833] mt-10 mb-4">What to Do if the Site Remains Unreachable</h2>
      <p class="mb-6">
        If you’ve tried all the fixes and the primary links are still not working, don't worry. There are several other reputable <strong>soccer streams</strong> platforms available. However, <strong>Soccer100</strong> remains the preferred choice for most fans due to its redundant link system and commitment to HD quality.
      </p>

      <div class="theme-card p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/10 my-10 bg-white/5 shadow-inner">
